  "best_proof": "theorem InitsUpdatesComm\n  {P : PureExpr} {σ σ' σ'' : SemanticStore P}\n  {ks ks' : List P.Ident} {vs vs' : List P.Expr} :\n  UpdateStates σ ks vs σ' →\n  InitStates σ' ks' vs' σ'' →\n  ∃ σ₁,\n    σ₁ = (updatedStates σ ks' vs') ∧\n    InitStates σ ks' vs' σ₁ ∧\n    UpdateStates σ₁ ks vs σ'' :=\n  fun u i => ⟨_, rfl, updatedStatesInit (InitStatesLength i) (UpdateStatesNotDefMonotone' (InitStatesNotDefined i) u) $ InitStatesNodup i, by\n    simp only [InitStatesUpdated i, UpdateStatesUpdated u]\n    unfold updatedStates\n    rw [updatedStatesComm]\n    exact updatedStatesUpdate (UpdateStatesLength u) $ updatedStatesDefMonotone $ UpdateStatesDefined' u\n    simp only [List.unzip_zip $ UpdateStatesLength u, List.unzip_zip $ InitStatesLength i]\n    exact fun _ a b => absurd (UpdateStatesDefined u _ a) $ InitStatesNotDefined i _ b ▸ Bool.false_ne_true⟩\n",
